@startuml
title UC-01 Generate New Password - analysis sequence diagram

actor ":AccountHolder" as AH
participant ":GeneratorController" as GC <<control>>
participant ":PasswordCriteria" as PC
participant ":GeneratedPassword" as GP

AH -> GC : 1 submits length, allowed characters and required strength
create PC
GC -> PC : 2 records the chosen restrictions
GC -> PC : 3 asks whether the restrictions conflict

alt restrictions are consistent
  PC --> GC : 4 reports the restrictions are consistent
else A1: restrictions conflict
  PC --> GC : 4a reports which restrictions conflict
  GC --> AH : 4b tells the account holder what conflicts and asks to change it
end

loop repeated while the account holder rejects the password (10c, A2)
  GC -> PC : 5 asks for a password that fits the restrictions
  create GP
  PC -> GP : 6 produces a candidate password
  GC -> GP : 7 asks for its strength rating
  GP --> GC : 8 reports its strength rating
  GC --> AH : 9 shows the password and its strength rating
  opt A2: rejects the password
    AH -> GC : 10c rejects the password and asks for another
  end
end

alt accepts
  AH -> GC : 10 accepts the password
  GC --> AH : 11 confirms the password is ready to use
else A3: cancels
  AH -> GC : 10a cancels
  GC --> AH : 10b confirms no password was kept
end

@enduml
